<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<odoo>
    <template id="diligence_homepage_reference_content" inherit_id="website.homepage" name="Homepage Reference Testimonials and Teachers">
        <xpath expr="//section[@data-name='Testimonials']" position="replace">
            <section class="s_carousel_wrapper academy-testimonials pt80 pb80" data-snippet="s_carousel" data-name="Testimonials">
                <div id="diligence-testimonials-carousel" class="carousel slide" data-bs-ride="false"><div class="container"><div class="text-center mb-5"><span class="text-uppercase fw-bold text-primary">Kind words from our students</span><h2 class="display-5 fw-bold mt-2">Apa kata siswa tentang Diligence Academy?</h2><p class="lead text-muted">Pengalaman belajar yang nyata dari siswa kami.</p></div><div class="carousel-inner">
                    <div class="carousel-item active"><div class="row justify-content-center"><div class="col-lg-8"><div class="card border h-100 p-4"><div class="card-body text-center"><div class="text-warning mb-3">★★★★★</div><p class="lead mb-4">“My writing has improved after three months of studying. I think this English course is my best decision ever.”</p><p class="fw-bold mb-0">Anna</p><small class="text-muted">Malaysia</small></div></div></div></div></div>
                    <div class="carousel-item"><div class="row justify-content-center"><div class="col-lg-8"><div class="card border h-100 p-4"><div class="card-body text-center"><div class="text-warning mb-3">★★★★★</div><p class="lead mb-4">“I have learned a lot from you, especially when I found out that I get to use more English now and it feels natural.”</p><p class="fw-bold mb-0">Supadmi</p><small class="text-muted">Batam</small></div></div></div></div></div>
                    <div class="carousel-item"><div class="row justify-content-center"><div class="col-lg-8"><div class="card border h-100 p-4"><div class="card-body text-center"><div class="text-warning mb-3">★★★★★</div><p class="lead mb-4">“The class is comfortable. My listening and writing have improved a lot as well.”</p><p class="fw-bold mb-0">Yuliani</p><small class="text-muted">Batam</small></div></div></div></div></div>
                </div><button class="carousel-control-prev" type="button" data-bs-target="#diligence-testimonials-carousel" data-bs-slide="prev"><span class="carousel-control-prev-icon" aria-hidden="true"/><span class="visually-hidden">Previous</span></button><button class="carousel-control-next" type="button" data-bs-target="#diligence-testimonials-carousel" data-bs-slide="next"><span class="carousel-control-next-icon" aria-hidden="true"/><span class="visually-hidden">Next</span></button></div></div>
                <div class="oe_structure oe_empty diligence-testimonials-drop-zone"/>
            </section>
        </xpath>
        <xpath expr="//section[@data-name='Meet Our Teachers']" position="replace">
            <section class="s_three_columns academy-teachers o_cc o_cc2 pt80 pb80" data-snippet="s_three_columns" data-name="Meet Our Teachers">
                <div class="container"><div class="text-center mb-5"><span class="text-uppercase fw-bold text-primary">Meet some of our teachers</span><h2 class="display-5 fw-bold mt-2">Belajar bersama pengajar berpengalaman</h2><p class="lead text-muted">Kenali tim pengajar Diligence English.</p></div><div class="row g-4">
                    <div class="col-lg-4"><div class="card border-0 h-100"><div class="card-body p-4 text-center"><img class="academy-teacher-photo" src="https://diligenceenglish.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/photo-1-e1595743112221.png" alt="Ms. Lidya C. Yowendro" loading="lazy"/><h3 class="h4">Ms. Lidya C. Yowendro</h3><p class="text-muted mb-0">English teacher</p></div></div></div>
                    <div class="col-lg-4"><div class="card border-0 h-100"><div class="card-body p-4 text-center"><img class="academy-teacher-photo" src="https://diligenceenglish.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/FWY.jpg" alt="Mr. Felix W. Yowendro" loading="lazy"/><h3 class="h4">Mr. Felix W. Yowendro</h3><p class="text-muted mb-0">English teacher</p></div></div></div>
                    <div class="col-lg-4"><div class="card border-0 h-100"><div class="card-body p-4 text-center"><img class="academy-teacher-photo" src="https://diligenceenglish.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/DVY2-e1595743726187.jpg" alt="Ms. Diana V. Yowendro" loading="lazy"/><h3 class="h4">Ms. Diana V. Yowendro</h3><p class="text-muted mb-0">English teacher</p></div></div></div>
                </div><p class="small text-muted text-center mt-4 mb-0">Profil pengajar dirujuk dari <a href="https://diligenceenglish.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Diligence English</a>.</p></div>
            </section>
        </xpath>
    </template>
    <template id="diligence_homepage_testimony_text_override" inherit_id="website.homepage" name="Homepage Exact Testimony Text">
        <xpath expr="//div[@id='diligence-testimonials-carousel']//div[contains(concat(' ', normalize-space(@class), ' '), ' carousel-inner ')]" position="replace">
            <div class="carousel-indicators"><button type="button" data-bs-target="#diligence-testimonials-carousel" data-bs-slide-to="0" class="active" aria-current="true" aria-label="Testimonial 1"/><button type="button" data-bs-target="#diligence-testimonials-carousel" data-bs-slide-to="1" aria-label="Testimonial 2"/><button type="button" data-bs-target="#diligence-testimonials-carousel" data-bs-slide-to="2" aria-label="Testimonial 3"/><button type="button" data-bs-target="#diligence-testimonials-carousel" data-bs-slide-to="3" aria-label="Testimonial 4"/></div><div class="carousel-inner">
                <div class="carousel-item active"><div class="row justify-content-center"><div class="col-lg-8"><div class="card border h-100 p-4"><div class="card-body text-center"><div class="text-warning mb-3">★★★★★</div><p class="mb-4">Saya sudah les Mandarin di Diligence Academy sekitar 3 tahun. Pengalaman saya selama belajar Mandarin di Diligence sangat bagus. Mandarin saya meningkat drastis seperti dalam mengenal dan menulis tulisan mandarin, mengenal nada, membaca dan menghafal. Bahkan saya sering dipuji oleh guru Mandarin di sekolah karena rata-rata nilai dikte ulanganku mencapai nilai 100.</p><p class="fw-bold mb-0">Ivonne</p><small class="text-muted">Mandarin Group Class Student</small></div></div></div></div></div>
                <div class="carousel-item"><div class="row justify-content-center"><div class="col-lg-8"><div class="card border h-100 p-4"><div class="card-body text-center"><div class="text-warning mb-3">★★★★★</div><p class="mb-4">Miss, thank you for choosing me as one of the most diligent students. I am so glad. Why I am able to learn so diligently is because English is my favourite subject. English is also a very important language. So I want to learn more about it. Although we are learning online because of the covid. I shall continue to learn it. I shall not give up until one day I can master English well like my teacher, miss Diana. My favourites are dictation and memorization.</p><p class="fw-bold mb-0">Nicole Febricia</p><small class="text-muted">English Group Class Student</small></div></div></div></div></div>
                <div class="carousel-item"><div class="row justify-content-center"><div class="col-lg-8"><div class="card border h-100 p-4"><div class="card-body text-center"><div class="text-warning mb-3">★★★★★</div><p class="mb-4">I have been learning English at Diligence Academy for 4 and a half years and my English has improved a lot since then. Before I joined the English class, I knew very little English. But since I started learning English at Diligence Academy, my English has gotten better and better every day. Now my English is at the intermediate level and I am hoping that I will get to upper intermediate level next year. So in conclusion, Diligence Academy has played a big part in my journey of learning English and I am really grateful for that.</p><p class="fw-bold mb-0">Alicia</p><small class="text-muted">English Group Class Student</small></div></div></div></div></div>
                <div class="carousel-item"><div class="row justify-content-center"><div class="col-lg-8"><div class="card border h-100 p-4"><div class="card-body text-center"><div class="text-warning mb-3">★★★★★</div><p class="mb-4">Saya adalah murid Inggris Diligence, saya telah les di Diligence Academy sekitar 2,5 tahun. Saya les Inggris di sini dikarenakan saya melihat murid lain yang les di Diligence sangat lancar berbicara English, makanya itu saya daftar les di Diligence, dan saya ditakdirkan untuk berguru dengan Madam, beliau sangat sabar dalam menghadapi skill English saya, dan sangat bijak dalam mengajar. Semoga Diligence dapat menjadi kursus yg besar dan dapat mengajar lebih banyak ilmu dan bahasa, Thank You Madam, Love you Madam.</p><p class="fw-bold mb-0">Ivonne</p><small class="text-muted">English Group Class Student</small></div></div></div></div></div>
            </div>
        </xpath>
    </template>
</odoo>
